OL,3,GNEWSAFifty firefighters tackle large   
OL,4,Afire in Antrim                         
OL,6,FFifty firefighers are tackling a large 
OL,7,Ffire at a factory in Antrim in a       
OL,8,Foperation which is expected to last    
OL,9,Fmost of Thursday.                      
OL,11,FThe blaze broke out at the site on the 
OL,12,FGreystone Road in the Ballycraigy area 
OL,13,Fof the town.                           
OL,15,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue   
OL,16,FService (NIFRS) has deployed eight fire
OL,17,Fengines, an aerial appliance and a     
OL,18,Fcommand support unit to the scene.     
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
