OL,3,GNEWSAFifty firefighters tackle large   
OL,4,Afire in Antrim                         
OL,6,FMembers of the public have been asked  
OL,7,Fto avoid the area and local residents  
OL,8,Fhave been advised to keep their windows
OL,9,Fand doors closed.                      
